      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.15 (vs ₹0.26 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.15 (down from ₹0.26 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹441.0m (up 1.6% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹4.10m (down 45% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.9% (down from 1.7% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 66% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 77% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
